+## Verdict and classification
+
+**FIXED.** REAL on this branch, classified **test** — a test-source portability defect in
+the Windows-only named-pipe cases, not CI infrastructure and not a product runtime defect.
+
+Hosted `build / windows-arm64` (run 43681793608, job 132713785114) on pinned train
+050/m0-train-32 at `dec3f1d45c62b26bce955875521780db173a0228` stopped while compiling
+`tests/src/core/ControlShutdownHookTest.cpp`:
+
+```
+tests/src/core/ControlShutdownHookTestParts1.h:149:33: error: use of undeclared identifier
+'ClientIdleTimeoutMs'; did you mean 'lmms::ControlServer::ClientIdleTimeoutMs'?
+...
+6 errors generated.
+```
